  "about_founder_desc": "Conducted multi-dimensional and multi-scale design studies for many projects over the years.\n\nShaping the interior space from an architectural perspective, using Spatial Narrative logic to infuse each work with spatial emotion.\n\nHe has unique professional understanding of different projects，especially good at using curved surfaces to create a tense spatial language，currently has successfully shaped a number of recognizable, forward-looking space image。",
  "about_company_img": "/images/works/Image Wall.jpg",
  "about_company_desc": "ERAN DESIGN, founded in Shenzhen, China.\n\nWe design across industries，beyond trends, we create forward-thinking design unify your vision.\nPay attention to social trends and lifestyle behavioral experiences, and seek insights and strategies in every design.\n\nConstructing Space with an architectural perspective，use narrative logic to inject spatial emotion into each work.\n\nWe craft <span>High Recognizable, Sustainable and Complete Design Solutions</span> for every business.",
